 * A strict CSP header value: scripts only by nonce with 'strict-dynamic', no plugins (object-src), no <base>
 * hijacking, no framing (frame-ancestors), images from 'self' only, connect-src 'self' plus the given origins, and
 * report-to <reportTo> last when given. No 'unsafe-inline' and no wildcards.
 * Throw if the base64 nonce is shorter than 128 bits (message mentioning "128 bits"), and if a connect entry is not
 * a bare https:// or wss:// origin ("https or wss"); parse entries with new URL(), which throws "Invalid URL".
 */
